<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43731" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔειρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶρος, ἔριον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with</i> or <i>of good wool, fleecy</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.187
			</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.657
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>):—
				Att.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔερος</span></b>  (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				122
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				675
			</span></i> (Lob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐείρῳ</span>);
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔερόν τ᾽ ἄγραν</span> (Schneidew.
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔκερών τ᾽</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				297
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τινα πόλιν φράσειας ἡμῖν εὔερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῶσσαν εὐέρων βοτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					175
				</span></i>
			: heterocl. acc. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔειρας</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτῆρας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				751
			</span></i>.</div>
